    "title": "“吉聚人才 就在吉林”吉林省2023届高校毕业生国有企业专场招聘会",
    "source": "市场部",
    "publishDate": "2023-05-08",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 为深入贯彻党的二十大精神，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">推</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">动吉林省高质量发展，留住人才、吸引人才，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉林</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">省人社厅、</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉林</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">省教育厅、</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉林</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">省国资委联合举</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">办</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">“吉聚人才 ‘就’在吉林</span></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉林省国有企业招聘</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">2023届高校毕业生专场活动”</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">具体内容如下：</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 一、活动名称</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 吉聚人才</span> <span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">“就”在吉林</span></span></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉林省国有企业招聘</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">2023届高校毕业生专场活动</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 二、</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">组织</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">机构</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 主办单位：</span></strong></span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉林</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">省人力资源和社会保障厅</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 吉林</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">省教育厅</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉林省人民政府国有资产监督管理委员会</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 承办</span></strong></span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">单位：</span></strong></span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">中国吉林高新技术人才市场指导委员会办公室</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">（吉林</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 省人才交流开发中心）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉林省高校毕业生就业指导中心</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉林省国有资本运营有限责任公司</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 吉林省大学生就业创业指导站</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 协</span></strong></span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">办单位：</span></strong></span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">吉林</span></span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">省人</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">力</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">资</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">源服务有限责任</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">公司（彩虹公司）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 三、大会时间</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 2023年5月15日（星期一）8：30-11</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">:30</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 四、大会地点</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 线下：</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉林省人才市场一楼交流大厅（长春市建设街</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">2650号）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 线上：</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">96885</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉人在线</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">96885.hrss.jl.gov.cn</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 吉聚人才云平台</span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">jlhr.com.cn</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 吉林省高校毕业生就业信息网</span></span></span><a href=\"https://cms.jilinjobs.cn/about\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif\">www.jilinjobs.cn</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 吉林人才网</span>www.jlrc.com.cn</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">五、</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">活动</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\">内容</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 大会将在</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">“96885吉人在线”平台、</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉聚人才云平台、吉林省高校毕业生就业信息网、</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉林人才网等官方平台大力开展大会宣传推广，并在线上线下同步进行。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:楷体\"><span style=\"font-family:楷体\">&nbsp; &nbsp; （一）线下</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:楷体\"><span style=\"font-family:楷体\">交流会</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 现场参会单位以国企为主，预计参会单位达</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">100家。现场还将提供人才登记、政策咨询、职业指导等系列服务。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:楷体\"><span style=\"font-family:楷体\">&nbsp; &nbsp; （二）线上专区</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 在</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">“96885吉人在线”、吉林省人才交流开发中心官网、吉林省高校毕业生就业指导中心官网、吉林人才网搭建大会线上招聘专区，吸引以国企为主的省内各类有人才需求的单位积极参加大会。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:楷体\"><span style=\"font-family:楷体\">&nbsp; &nbsp; （三）直播带岗</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 大会线下交流会现场，将通过</span><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">“吉林省人才交流开发中心官方抖音号”同步开启直播带岗，就单位经营情况、岗位需求情况逐一进行企业采访，强化大会互动性。</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">吉林省人才交流开发中心</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS,cursive\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0000pt\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2023年5月8日</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-size:21.3333px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n                    ",
